---
import { business } from '../data/site';
---

<section class="intro-band" aria-label="About Shepard Excavating">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow">Northern Minnesota, since {business.founded}</p>
    <p class="intro-text">
      Shepard Excavating and Septic Service has dug, hauled, and plowed across Beltrami, Hubbard,
      and Cass counties since {business.founded}. We are an MPCA-certified septic installer who
      handles the whole job: drain fields and mound systems, pumping, excavating, land clearing,
      demolition, sand and gravel, and winter snow removal. We work for homeowners, cabin owners,
      and builders around Bemidji, Park Rapids, Walker, and the Leech Lake area. One local crew,
      one call, and a straight answer on what your project needs.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .intro-band { background: var(--stone); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); padding-block: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 2.8rem); }
  .intro-text { max-width: 68ch; font-size: clamp(1.08rem, 1.6vw, 1.28rem); line-height: 1.6; color: var(--ink); margin-top: 0.8rem; }
</style>
